{"3722970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Higher: The Last Dream", "steam_appid": 3722970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Higher: The Last Dream is an immersive 2D platformer in which you play as Starlight, a hero of light cast into lost worlds, drained of all color and joy. The legendary flames must be rekindled so that each world can shine again. But behind every world he crosses lies a truth he no longer remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/54028b801c56170fb94d807aa9e5df3d.poster.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/54028b801c56170fb94d807aa9e5df3d.webm?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/54028b801c56170fb94d807aa9e5df3d.mp4?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full movement system (running, jumping, multidirectional dash, drill, climbing, wall-grab, swimming...)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense boss battles with unique patterns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A die &amp; retry system built on determination</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranged, special, and melee attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dreamlike and  pixel art world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An immersive original soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story driven by inner struggle</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.poster.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.webm?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.mp4?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nervous Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform (Gamepad + Mouse / Keyboard)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game representated by chapters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level design telling stories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiples Endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/df7829ca9ede7a2a2e49eca18f7fd1b5.poster.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/df7829ca9ede7a2a2e49eca18f7fd1b5.webm?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/df7829ca9ede7a2a2e49eca18f7fd1b5.mp4?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a universe between dreams and reality, Starlight, a hero of light awakened in darkness, must ascend the skies and confront the surrounding obscurity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you'll meet new endearing, mysterious, and quirky characters, and face mythical creatures that stand in your way. Lost in the unknown and having lost your memory, rekindle Starlight's eternal flame by rediscovering the hero's forgotten memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/8d794b72c0e76fbb8520705d94b9e4f2.poster.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/8d794b72c0e76fbb8520705d94b9e4f2.webm?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/8d794b72c0e76fbb8520705d94b9e4f2.mp4?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/b3127c0cdcc36b1fedd13fa36c65d2fe.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Higher: The Last Dream is an immersive 2D platformer in which you play as Starlight, a hero of light cast into lost worlds, drained of all color and joy. The legendary flames must be rekindled so that each world can shine again. But behind every world he crosses lies a truth he no longer remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/54028b801c56170fb94d807aa9e5df3d.poster.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/54028b801c56170fb94d807aa9e5df3d.webm?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/54028b801c56170fb94d807aa9e5df3d.mp4?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full movement system (running, jumping, multidirectional dash, drill, climbing, wall-grab, swimming...)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense boss battles with unique patterns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A die &amp; retry system built on determination</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranged, special, and melee attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dreamlike and  pixel art world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An immersive original soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story driven by inner struggle</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/0bda06d5fc3f5b666301525be5e5b4ae.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.poster.avif?t=1787245773\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.webm?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722970/extras/727de6a6563861436bdb595121644e02.mp4?t=1787245773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nervous Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform (Gamepad + Mouse / Keyboard)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game representated by chapters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level design telling stories</strong></p></li><